GeoReason
Copyright 2026 the GeoReason authors.

GeoReason builds on Sa2VA (ByteDance), Qwen3-VL (Alibaba Cloud), and
Segment Anything 2 (Meta). The Sa2VA model supplies the pretrained Qwen3-VL
and SAM2 components. Training prompt templates and segmentation objectives
are adapted from Sa2VA and its LISA/GLAMM and OpenMMLab dependencies.

Upstream projects:
https://github.com/bytedance/Sa2VA
https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL
https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2
https://github.com/dvlab-research/LISA
https://github.com/mbzuai-oryx/groundingLMM
https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection

Model weights and datasets retain their respective upstream licenses.
